    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "אכלו \/ ואכלהו \/ ויכלהו",
      "rationale": "Tupela-tupela tok 'kaikai' i kamap klostu — olsem singaut i strong; Tok Pisin i holim wanwan tasol."
